{
  "slug": "semanticsearch",
  "name": "Semanticsearch",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A fully offline semantic search tool for Claude. Index local files (PDF, DOCX, Markdown, TXT, PPTX, CSV) into a vector database and search them using natural language. Uses hybrid search combining vector similarity with full-text keyword matching for accurate retrieval. Supports incremental indexing, 50+ languages, and runs entirely on your machine — no API keys, no data leaves your device.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `semantic-search` (Search local document folders using natural language)\n- **Commands** (1): `index` (Index a folder of documents for semantic search)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `semantic-search`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install semanticsearch@claude-community` from `ZhuBit/cowork-semantic-search`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
